---
import { buttonVariants } from "../components/ui/button";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" class="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>登录 · 伴侣小生命</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="grid min-h-dvh place-items-center bg-background p-6">
      <div class="w-full max-w-sm rounded-xl border bg-card p-8 text-center text-card-foreground shadow-sm">
        <h1 class="text-lg font-semibold">登录还没做</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          这个演示没有账号系统：这里只有占位页，不接后端，也不发请求。
        </p>
        <a class={`mt-6 ${buttonVariants({ variant: "outline" })}`} href="/">回到对话</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
